            "review_title": "Review at Hạ Phố Cafe",
            "review_text": "Duong T\n10 contributions\n0\nA relaxing café in the Lê Lai area, Hà Đông, Hà Nội.\nDec 2025 • Friends\nA small, cozy café with lots of greenery. The drinks are quite good for the price. I find the coffee fragrant with a pure, rustic taste, and the Peach Rice Milk Tea is outstanding. A big plus is the abundance of flowers and artistic paintings throughout the café\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2025",
